  - id: C:governance/board
    type: governance
    name: The board of directors
    summary: "A self-electing board: no members or stockholders. At the end of the year to June 2025 it had 12 voting seats, 11 of them independent, up from 7 seats in 2019. An audit oversight committee oversees the independent audit and a compensation committee sets chief executive pay. Written conflict-of-interest, whistleblower and document-retention policies are in place."
    elected-by: self
    voting-seats: 12
    independent-seats: 11
